      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "RADIO RAMSGATE (1) has been mixing form lately, hitting the frame two back before finishing sixth (17.64) at this track in a Grade 6. Expecting sharp improvement this line-up. WIN'S FOR FUN (2) started big odds last time but hit the ground running with a slick early split, giving a sight but fading out of it to finish fourth (17.59) at this track over 300m. Has performed well from this box with a win and two minor placings to her name from three starts. Can figure in the finish. ITA KEEPING (8) was safely held last time out, finishing seventh at this track over 300m behind Round Up (17.66) in a Grade 6. The form from her last run is stacking up nicely. Has ability and can atone. IN HER PRIME (7) should bounce back after an unplaced effort here recently.",
